	"name": "Arcanotechnologist",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/consumables/potions/flask-corked-blue-glow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your skill with technomagical inventions exceeds that of even other artificers, and you have learned to squeeze that little bit extra out of your devices. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Intelligence, or Wisdom score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Engineering skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Engineering increases to a d10. You also gain an Engineering skill specialty. It does not count against your skill specialties known.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with sewing kits, smith’s tools or a type of artisan’s tools of your choice.</p></li><li><p>When throwing items of a type you can make with your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.f2syblzgm6at7i7q]{Tactical Chemistry} feature you can throw them twice as far as usual.</p></li><li><p>You can combine a spell invention into a melee weapon. When a spell invention is combined into a weapon this way, it costs 10% more than usual, but the weapon functions as a spell focus for the spell. The weapon is still usable if the spell invention fizzles.</p></li></ul>",
